  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]\n[A]  [Bm]\n[A]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]Lying beside you,\n[A]Here in the dark, [Bm]\nFeeling your [A]heart beat with\n[G]mine.\n[D]Softly you whisper;\n[A]\"You're so sincere.\" [Bm]\nHow could our [A]love be so\n[G]blind. We\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Em]sailed on together. We\n[Bm]drifted apart, [A]And\n[D]here you [A]are by my\n[G]side. [A]\n[G][A]So now I\n\n[Chorus]\n[D]come to you, With\n[D/F#]open arms.\n[G]Nothing to hide, Be-\n[C]lieve what I say. So\n[D]here I am, With\n[D/F#]open arms,\n[G]Hoping you'll see, What your\n[C]love means to me. Open\n\n[Bridge]\n[D]arms.\n[A]  [Bm]\n[Bm]  [A]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D]Living withoutyou,\n[A]Living alone, [Bm]\nThis empty [A]house seems so\n[G]cold.\n[D]Wanting to hold you,\n[A]Wanting you near. [Bm]\nHow much I [A]wanted ah you\n[G]home. But\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Em]now that you've come back, Turned\n[Bm]night into day, [A]\n[D]I [A]need you to\n[G]stay. [A]\n[G][A]So now I\n\n[Chorus]\n[D]come to you, With\n[D/F#]open arms.\n[G]Nothing to hide, Be-\n[C]lieve what I say. So\n[D]here I am, With\n[D/F#]open arms,\n[G]Hoping you'll see, What your\n[C]love means to me. Open\n\n[Outro]\n[D]arms.\n[Am]\n[G]  [C]\n[D]",
